<li><strong>Cosmetics and personal care</strong> products</li>
<li><strong>Electronic and IT products</strong> such as accessories, chargers and gadgets</li>
</ul>
<p>Read more in our guide to <a href="/resources/blogs/lmpc-certification-for-manufacturers-and-packers-in-india">LMPC for manufacturers and packers</a>.</p>

<h2>Tamil Nadu State or Central LMPC: Which Should You Choose?</h2>
<p>You can take the LMPC certificate from either authority:</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th></th><th>Tamil Nadu state registration</th><th>Central registration</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
