<p><strong>Both certificates are equally valid.</strong> The state route can take longer and may involve a physical audit after you apply. At Instacertify, we make sure your <strong>central LMPC is issued on time</strong>, so you save time, cost and the hassle of renewals while staying equally compliant. We compare the two routes in more detail in our <a href="/resources/blogs/central-vs-state-lmpc-registration-importers-packers">guide to central and state LMPC registration</a>.</p>

<h2>Documents You Will Need</h2>
<ul>
<li>Proof of business: GST registration, incorporation certificate or partnership deed</li>
