<li>List of products and sample label artwork</li>
</ul>
<p>Requirements can vary with the product and the route, and we confirm the exact list before filing.</p>

<h2>What Your Package Label Must Show</h2>
<p>Registration is half the job; your labels must also carry the Legal Metrology declarations. The main ones are:</p>
<ul>
<li>Name and address of the manufacturer, packer or importer</li>
<li>Country of origin, for imported goods</li>
<li>Common or generic name of the product</li>
<li>Net quantity in standard units</li>
<li>Month and year of manufacture or import</li>
<li>Maximum retail price (MRP) inclusive of all taxes</li>
<li>Consumer care details</li>
</ul>
<p>We review your label artwork before printing so that goods are not stopped at customs or in the market for a missing declaration.</p>

